# Build context of the dashboard image (context: this directory, `COPY . .`).
#
# node_modules: an installed tree would overwrite the image's own install, and
# pnpm then stops on « The modules directory ... will be removed and reinstalled
# from scratch. Proceed? (Y/n) », which no build answers.
node_modules
**/node_modules
# The bundle Vite writes (outDir: build), built again in the image.
build
dist
# Test outputs.
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
playwright
playwright-results.json
.git
# Vite reads .env files at build time: a local one (.env.local) would be baked
# into the bundle. Every value comes from the build arguments or, in the
# Community image, from config.js at runtime.
.env*
